/// A counter released over three major versions, to show how the directory lists and
/// compares a package's versions.
///
/// A synthetic package: it isn't published to any registry.
package kitchen-sink:releases@2.0.0;

/// A counter, counting up from zero by any amount, or back to it.
interface counter {
  /// The current count, now wide enough to never wrap.
  get: func() -> u64;

  /// Sets the count back to zero.
  reset: func();

  /// Adds to the count.
  add: func(n: u64);
}
